    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Geomancer 16, Track, Swift Tracker, and Quarry geomancy tricks</p><p>The geomancer's ability to hunt her quarry improves. She can now select a quarry as a free action, and can now take 20 while using Survival to track her quarry, while moving at normal speed without penalty. Her insight bonus to attack her quarry increases to +4. If her quarry is killed or dismissed, she can select a new one after 10 minutes have passed.</p>",
